12
00:01:24,036 --> 00:01:27,110
But again, implicitly
here we are assuming.

13
00:01:27,110 --> 00:01:46,570
So assume that there exists
some c, so that for all n a-n

14
00:01:46,570 --> 00:01:47,470
is less than c.

15
00:01:47,470 --> 00:01:51,250
In other words, the c are
bounded from above, right?

16
00:01:51,250 --> 00:01:56,290
So if the sequence a-n
is bounded from above,

17
00:01:56,290 --> 00:02:02,430
then this here gives
us a real number,

18
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:11,190
